  "slug": "line-startup-production-log-form",
  "title": "Line Startup Production Log Form",
  "subtitle": "Control the starting state, record chronological production line clearance, setup, and controlled release activity, reconcile quantities and holds, authorize restarts, and hand off the next due check.",
  "description": "A chronological line startup production log form for reconstructing how a line, product, work order, and startup configuration moved through readiness, execution, interruptions, measurements, quantity reconciliation, exceptions, restart decisions, and shift closeout.",
  "use_case": "Use during active production line clearance, setup, and controlled release work when operators and reviewers need a time-ordered trace that identifies who did what, the actual result, affected range, and last known acceptable status.",
  "risk_tier": "A",
